  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2401.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2401.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish emissions standards for particulate matter and visible emissions from ferrous and non-ferrous foundries, smelters, and investment casting operations.\n\nSource. #6428-B, eff 1-18-97 (formerly Env-A 1206); ss by #8214, eff 11-24-04; ss by #10315, eff 4-23-13; ss by #13694, eff 7-22-23",
